      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Andrew, Damon and the boys have been absolutely fantastic.  From the very first assessment phase right through to the installation of the solar panels, the communication, explanation and itemised billing could not have been more precise.  The follow on monitoring and cleaning of the panels was also without problem.When the timing was appropriate, we upgraded to the battery backup, and we could not have been more pleased.  The system, quotes,rebates  have all been spot on.  No surprises .  The battery backup is absolutely fantastic and the whole system is viewed on our phones.We can not recommend Genevo highly enough.  We would never deal with anyone else, the quality of the product and the honesty of the tradesman is second to none. Thank you Mat and Tina Cherian",
